UID:gz-primal-fear-2026-1921303@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title></head><body aria-di
 sabled="false" spellcheck="false"><p>This Halloween season\, step into <st
 rong fr-original-style="" style="font-weight: 700\;">Primal Fear</strong>
 \, OWA&#39\;s most terrifying immersive attraction\, where your deepest fe
 ars become your reality.&nbsp\;</p><p>Open select nights: September 25&nda
 sh\;26 and October 2&ndash\;3\, 9&ndash\;10\, 16&ndash\;17\, and 22&ndash
 \;31\, 2026.&nbsp\;</p><p>Primal Fear takes guests on a psychological jour
 ney through a maze designed to awaken humanity&#39\;s most instinctive fea
 rs. From claustrophobic passageways and unsettling distortions to the chil
 ling sensation of being watched or hunted\, every room is crafted to keep 
 you questioning what waits around the next corner.&nbsp\;</p><p>As the dar
 kness closes in\, you&#39\;ll quickly discover that the greatest terror is
 n&#39\;t what you can see&mdash\;it&#39\;s what your mind creates. Every s
 ound\, shadow\, and unexpected encounter is designed to blur the line betw
 een imagination and reality\, delivering an experience that lingers long a
 fter you&#39\;ve escaped.&nbsp\;</p><p>Looking for an even greater challen
 ge? Upgrade your experience with exclusive add-ons\, including the Black-O
 ut Hour\, where the lights go out\, scare actors move to new locations\, a
 nd your only guide through the darkness is a small flashlight. Complete yo
 ur night with limited-time themed food and beverages\, exclusive Primal Fe
 ar merchandise\, and unforgettable memories&mdash\;if you make it out.&nbs
 p\;</p><p><strong fr-original-style="" style="font-weight: 700\;"><em>You 
 don&rsquo\;t find your fears. Your fears find you.</em></strong></p></body
 ></html>\n\n---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwi
 nchamber.com/calendar/Details/primal-fear-2026-1921303
LOCATION:Downtown OWA
END:VEVENT
