BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dedication & Commissioning Ceremony for The Schreiber Water Treatm
 ent Facility
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261110T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261110T000000
DTSTAMP:20261021T131757Z
UID:gz-dedication-commissioning-ceremony-for-the-schreiber-water-treatment
 -facility-1933252@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Riviera Utilities will celebrate a major investment in Baldwin
  County's growing water system with the dedication and commissioning of th
 e new Schreiber Water Treatment Plant on Tuesday\, November 10\, at 11 a.m
 . The ceremony will be held at the facility\, located at 120-B County Road
  20 in Foley\, and will include a dedication ceremony\, light bites\, and 
 tours of the new plant.\n\nThe facility will be named in honor of former R
 iviera Utilities Board Member Bob Schreiber\, recognizing his service and 
 contributions to the Utility and the community. Once the new facility is p
 laced into service\, Riviera's existing South Water Plant\, which is rated
  at 1\,500 gallons per minute\, will be retired. The Schreiber Water Treat
 ment Plant is designed to grow alongside the community\, with an ultimate 
 buildout capacity of 7\,000 gallons per minute\, or approximately 10 milli
 on gallons per day\, by 2035 through the addition of six future wells.\n\n
 ---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com
 /calendar/Details/dedication-commissioning-ceremony-for-the-schreiber-wate
 r-treatment-facility-1933252
LOCATION:The Schreiber Water Treatment Plant 120-B County Road 20\, Foley
 \, AL
END:VEVENT
