UID:gz-coco-montoya-1960573@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:Coco Montoya Live at OWA Theater\nExperience the power of the 
 blues with Coco Montoya!\nOWA Theater welcomes award-winning blues guitari
 st and vocalist Coco Montoya for an unforgettable night of soulful vocals
 \, fiery guitar work and authentic blues.\nMentored by blues legend Albert
  Collins and a longtime member of John Mayall’s Blues breakers\, Montoya
  has earned his place among the most respected performers in contemporary 
 blues. His passionate delivery\, inventive guitar playing and electrifying
  live performances make this a show blues fans won't want to miss.\nThis p
 erformance also marks a special milestone: OWA’s first show as the Offic
 ial Blues Venue of the Frank Brown International Songwriters’ Festival\,
  celebrating a new collaboration dedicated to bringing outstanding blues m
 usic to the stage.\nJoin us for one incredible night of live music on Tues
 day\, November 10\, at 7:30 PM.\nFeel the blues live at OWA Theater. Get y
 our tickets today!\n\n---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.s
 outhbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/coco-montoya-1960573
LOCATION:OWA theater
END:VEVENT
