DESCRIPTION:Friday\, December 4 - 7:30 PM - OWA Theater\nStep inside the s
 tudio and behind the glass for PET SOUNDS LIVE\, an immersive rock-and-rol
 l experience celebrating one of the most beloved and influential albums in
  music history.\nMore than a tribute and more than a concert\, PET SOUNDS 
 LIVE brings the story of Brian Wilson and The Beach Boys' masterpiece to l
 ife on stage through live music\, narration\, visual multimedia\, and fasc
 inating historical stories.\nExperience the complete Pet Sounds album perf
 ormed live\, along with Beach Boys classics including "California Girls\,"
  "Don't Worry\, Baby\," and the legendary "Good Vibrations."\nJourney back
  to the 1960s and experience the music\, creativity\, and story behind the
  album that helped redefine what was possible in popular music.\n\n---\n
 🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/cale
 ndar/Details/pet-sounds-live-1955573
LOCATION:OWA theater
END:VEVENT
