 -width: 100%\; cursor: pointer\; padding: 0px 1px\;" /><br /></p><p>Presen
 ted by <a fr-original-style="" href="https://www.vulcaninc.com/" style="us
 er-select: auto\;"><strong fr-original-style="" style="font-weight: 700\;"
 >Vulcan\, Inc.</strong></a>\, the <a fr-original-style="" href="https://ww
 w.southbaldwinchamber.com/leadership-series/" style="user-select: auto\;">
 <strong fr-original-style="" style="font-weight: 700\;">Leadership Series<
 /strong></a> is one of the South Baldwin Chamber of Commerce&rsquo\;s prem
 ier programs designed to keep members informed\, engaged\, and connected t
 o the issues shaping our region. Hosted eight times each year\, these lunc
 heons feature respected and influential speakers who bring insight on time
 ly topics impacting our business community.</p><p>From economic developmen
 t and tourism to local governance and state-level initiatives\, each progr
 am delivers relevant\, real-world perspective you can take back to your bu
 siness or organization. Just as important\, the Leadership Series provides
  valuable opportunities to build relationships with fellow professionals\,
  civic leaders\, and key decision-makers from across South Baldwin County.
 </p><hr fr-original-style="" style="clear: both\; user-select: none\; brea
 k-after: page\;" /><h4>Agenda</h4><ul fr-original-style="" style="list-sty
 le-position: inside\;"><li>11:00 AM: Private Workforce &amp\; Top Investor
 s&#39\; Meeting</li><li>11:30 AM: Buffet Lunch catered by <a fr-original-s
 tyle="" href="https://www.facebook.com/sugarlovefoodtruck" style="user-sel
 ect: auto\;">SugarLove&nbsp\;</a></li><li>12:00 PM: Program Begins</li></u
 l><hr fr-original-style="" style="clear: both\; user-select: none\; break-
 after: page\;" /><h4>Investing in the Future</h4><p>We are proud to recogn
 ize our Education Enrichment Sponsor\, <a fr-original-style="" href="https
 ://warrenaverett.com/offices/daphne" style="user-select: auto\;"><strong f
 r-original-style="" style="font-weight: 700\;">Warren Averett</strong></a>
 \, for helping connect today&rsquo\;s students with tomorrow&rsquo\;s oppo
 rtunities.</p><hr fr-original-style="" style="clear: both\; user-select: n
 one\; break-after: page\;" /><h4>Community Spotlight &mdash\; Local Nonpro
 fit Partners</h4><p>We are honored to highlight two organizations making a
  meaningful impact across Baldwin County:</p><ul fr-original-style="" styl
 e="list-style-position: inside\;"><li><a fr-original-style="" href="https:
 //businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/list/Details/jennifer-claire-moore-f
 oundation-inc-4616164" style="user-select: auto\;">Jennifer Claire Moore F
 oundation</a></li><li><a fr-original-style="" href="https://businesshub.so
 uthbaldwinchamber.com/list/Details/foley-sister-cities-commission-inc-4616
 159" style="user-select: auto\;">Foley Sister Cities Commission</a></li></
 ul></body></html>\n\n---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.so
