UID:gz-4th-annual-charity-golf-tournament-1921751@southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title></head><body aria-di
 sabled="false" spellcheck="false"><p>South Baldwin Republican Women will h
 ost its 4th Annual Charity Golf Tournament at Quail Creek Golf Course in F
 airhope on October 2\, 2026.&nbsp\;</p><p>Registration begins at noon\, an
 d Tee Time is at 1:00 PM. A portion of the proceeds will benefit Foster Ki
 ds Matter. We are raising money to support their work with foster children
  in Baldwin County. They provide 7 days of clothes\, shoes\, toiletries\, 
 a blanket\, a pillow and pillowcase\, and many other items that the childr
 en need when they enter foster care.&nbsp\;</p><p>Many of these children h
 ave only the clothes they are wearing at the time. We hope you can join us
  for an afternoon of fun and fellowship to support children in need.&nbsp
 \;</p><p>If you can&#39\;t attend\, we are accepting donations. You can do
 nate on our website under the Golf Tournament tab. No donation is too smal
 l for these children.</p><p><a fr-original-style="" href="http://www.south
 baldwinrepublicanwomen.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="user-select: 
 auto\;" target="_blank"><strong fr-original-style="" style="font-weight: 7
 00\;">www.southbaldwinrepublicanwomen.com</strong></a></p></body></html>\n
 \n---\n🌐 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.c
 om/calendar/Details/4th-annual-charity-golf-tournament-1921751
LOCATION:Quail Creek Golf Course 19841 Quail Creek Dr\, Fairhope\, AL
END:VEVENT
