SUMMARY:October ASPCA Rescue Effect Adoption Promotion at The Haven
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261003T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261004T000000
DTSTAMP:20261021T131757Z
UID:gz-october-aspca-rescue-effect-adoption-promotion-at-the-haven-1915522
 @southbaldwinchamber.com
DESCRIPTION:<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title></head><body aria-di
 sabled="false"><p><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/micronetonline/imag
 e/upload/q_auto\,f_auto\,c_limit\,w_1920\,h_1005/v1788539564/tenants/e82e5
 3eb-961d-4b13-bafd-8e5487751e05/fc05b5ded3e34f0fb7e95f22815784b0/ASPCA-Res
 cue-Effect-1920x1005.png" width="791" height="414" style="display: inline-
 block\; vertical-align: bottom\; margin-right: 5px\; margin-left: 5px\; ma
 x-width: calc(100% - 10px)\; text-align: center\; position: relative\; cur
 sor: pointer\; padding: 0px 1px\;" fr-original-style="display: inline-bloc
 k\; vertical-align: bottom\; margin-right: 5px\; margin-left: 5px\; max-wi
 dth: calc(100% - 10px)\; text-align: center\;" fr-original-class="fr-dragg
 able" /><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>🐾 Adopt One\, Help Many. That&rsquo\;
 s The Rescue Effect.&nbsp\;</p><p>The Haven is proud to participate in the
  ASPCA&rsquo\;s Rescue Effect\, a nationwide campaign helping more shelter
  pets find loving homes.&nbsp\;</p><p>Thanks to a $10\,000 grant from the 
 ASPCA\, adoption fees will be completely waived for eligible dogs and cats
  ages 6 months and older at The Haven during our October Rescue Effect pro
 motional period: October 3&ndash\;17\, 2026</p><p>&nbsp\;Regular adoption 
 fees of $150 for adult cats and $200 for adult dogs will be waived during 
 the promotion.&nbsp\;</p><p>❤️ What stays the same?&nbsp\;</p><p>Our a
 doption application and approval process. Removing the adoption fee remove
 s one financial barrier&mdash\;not our commitment to finding the right mat
 ch between pets and families.&nbsp\;</p><p>Every adoption changes the life
  of the pet going home while also creating space\, time and resources to h
 elp the next homeless animal who needs us. That&rsquo\;s the ripple behind
  The Rescue Effect.&nbsp\;</p><p>Our goal is to place 51 adult cats and do
 gs into loving homes during the August&ndash\;October campaign\, and your 
 adoption can help us get there!&nbsp\;</p><p>📅 October 3&ndash\;17\, 20
 26&nbsp\;</p><p>🐶🐱 Eligible dogs and cats: 6 months and older&nbsp\;
 </p><p>💙 Adoption fees: WAIVED&nbsp\;</p><p>📍 The Haven for Animals&
 nbsp\;</p><p>View our available pets and learn more about The Rescue Effec
 t here: https://www.havenforanimals.org/aspca-rescue-effect/&nbsp\;</p><p>
 We encourage prospective adopters to view available pets and complete the 
 adoption application before visiting The Haven.&nbsp\;</p><p>Adopt One. He
 lp Many. That&rsquo\;s The Rescue Effect.&nbsp\;</p><p>#TheRescueEffect #H
 avenForAnimals #AdoptDontShop #PetAdoption</p></body></html>\n\n---\n🌐 
 View original event: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/
 Details/october-aspca-rescue-effect-adoption-promotion-at-the-haven-191552
 2
LOCATION:The Haven for Animals 559 S Section Street\, Fairhope\, AL
END:VEVENT
