 iring afternoon at our first annual Healthy Women luncheon. Designed to sp
 ark conversation and foster connections across our community\, this inaugu
 ral gathering brings together neighbors\, local leaders\, and health advoc
 ates around a shared commitment to well-being and vital living.</p><p>As g
 uests enjoy a light mid-day meal\, the heart of the event will unfold with
