DESCRIPTION:Get ready to relive the music of one of the most iconic duos i
 n pop history!\nPrivate Eyes\, the premier tribute to Daryl Hall & John Oa
 tes\, returns to OWA Theater for an unforgettable night filled with timele
 ss hits\, soulful vocals\, incredible musicianship\, and all the nostalgia
  you love.\nFormed in 2018\, the Los Angeles-based ensemble was created wi
 th one goal: to faithfully recreate the unmistakable sound of Hall & Oates
 . With a six- to seven-piece band featuring some of LA's finest musicians
 \, Private Eyes delivers pristine vocal harmonies\, dynamic instrumentatio
 n\, soulful saxophone\, and the signature rock-and-soul sound that made Ha
 ll & Oates legendary.\nSing along to favorites including "You Make My Drea
 ms (Come True)\," "Maneater\," "Rich Girl\," "Kiss on My List\," "She's Go
 ne\," "Sara Smile\," "I Can't Go for That (No Can Do)\," "Out of Touch\," 
 and more!\nWhether you've been a lifelong Hall & Oates fan or simply love 
 the music of the '70s and '80s\, Private Eyes delivers a high-energy tribu
 te that will have you singing\, dancing\, and wanting more.\nExperience Ha
 ll & Oates like never before! All the Hits!\n\n---\n🌐 View original eve
 nt: https://businesshub.southbaldwinchamber.com/calendar/Details/private-e
 yes-the-premier-tribute-to-daryl-hall-john-oates-1943104
LOCATION:OWA theater
END:VEVENT
